{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/copy-git-repo-mirroring/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"3f421e4b-c1fa-5a81-b6c2-6146349d0e6f","excerpt":"Copy your Git Repository to another (git mirroring) Clone your repository Set the push location to your mirror Push to your mirror c.f. git merge with commit…","html":"<h2>Copy your Git Repository to another (git mirroring)</h2>\n<h3>Clone your repository</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> clone <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--mirror</span> https://github.com/exampleuser/repository-to-mirror.git</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Set the push location to your mirror</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> repository-to-mirror.git\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> remote set-url origin https://github.com/exampleuser/mirrored.git</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Push to your mirror</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> push <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--mirror</span></code></pre></div>\n<h4>c.f. git merge with commit log</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> merge --no-ff <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>branch<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.atlassian.com/git/tutorials/using-branches/git-merge#:~:text=In%20the%20event%20that%20you,the%20%2D%2Dno%2Dff%20option.&#x26;text=This%20command%20merges%20the%20specified,a%20fast%2Dforward%20merge\">Git - git-merge Documentation</a>.)</p>\n<h4>c.f. update feature branch with develop branch</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">git:<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>develop<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> ✗ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> checkout feature-branch\ngit:<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>feature-branch<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> ✗ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> rebase develop</code></pre></div>","frontmatter":{"title":"Copy your Git Repository with commit log (git mirroring)","date":"May 26, 2023","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/colab-vs-jupyter/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"What's the difference between Colab and Jupyter?"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/laravel-upgrade-version-7-to-10/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Upgrade Laravel from version 7 to 10"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"3f421e4b-c1fa-5a81-b6c2-6146349d0e6f","previousPostId":"0e1a7dfe-a03b-5f70-b65e-3a05113164d1","nextPostId":"e095e6a5-5db4-5a62-9d49-14e19c127471"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}